@ 23.1.1.1 - Chibchan
# citation: The following phonemic inventory is adapted from Wheeler (1972). Information in this section may be missing or incomplete, as I found the source document using Google Books and several pages were not available in the preview. (From Wheeler, Alva (1972), “Proto-Chibchan”. In Matteson, Esther, ed., Comparative Studies in Amerindian Languages 93 – 108)